$WEATHER: Jean Pompeo lettuce experiments 2022
! 2026-11-03: light set to the Pompeo thesis value, LED 220 umol/m2/s for 16.5 h (hours 06-21 full, hour 22 half). PAR column 0.792 mol/m2/h (DLI 13.07); SRAD = 220/4.57 = 48.1 W/m2 (LED, nearly all PAR). Replaces the x1.5 SRAD below.
! 2026-10-30: hourly SRAD converted from MJ/m2/h to W/m2 (W/m2 = MJ/m2/h x 1E6/3600), matching Oliveira et al. Flexible I/O; HR2DLY sums W/m2 x 0.0036 to MJ/m2/d.
! SRAD recomputed 2026-10-05 from the PAR column: SRAD (MJ/m2/h) = PAR (mol/m2/h) / (4.6 * 0.45)
! Treatment  Transplant    Harvest
! T4 (30C)   2022-03-02    2022-03-30
! T1 (24C)   2022-04-13    2022-05-11
! T3 (28C)   2022-07-14    2022-08-11
! T2 (26C)   2022-08-31    2022-09-28
!
! LUX/LUT/LUA dates updated to match transplant/harvest dates above.
! DOY 061-068 (T4 pre-transplant) filled with median hourly values from T4 observed period (DOY 069-089).
! Weather file starts at DOY 061. Simulation SDATE in LUX set to 22061.
! TMAX/TMIN replaced with measured day/night means from Pompeo thesis Table
! 3-1 (day=5:30-22:00 hr06-21, night=22:00-5:30 hr22-05), since raw logged
! values did not reliably track the intended per-treatment temperature and
! ENVIRONMENT MODIFICATIONS EMAX/EMIN overrides were removed in favor of
