!   E4 (30C nominal): day 29.5  night 19.4
! 2026-10-06: PAR column removed and SRAD multiplied by 1.5 (SRAD = 1.5 x PAR / (4.6 x 0.45)) by user decision; photosynthetic light is then driven by SRAD.
